SUMMARY:One Funny Lisa Marie
LOCATION:New York Comedy Club on 4th Street\, 85 East 4th Street\, New York
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an unforgettable show with viral comedy sensation
  One Funny Lisa Marie (Lisa Marie Riley)! Known for her wildly relatable hu
 mor and beloved TikTok videos\, Lisa has built a devoted community of more 
 than 500\,000 followers and has amassed over 14 million video views by find
 ing the funny in everyday life. From family chaos and Italian upbringing to
  marriage\, motherhood\, and the ups and downs we all experience\, Lisa tur
 ns life's most relatable moments into laugh-out-loud comedy. Now she's brin
 ging those stories from your phone screen to the live stage for a hilarious
  night of stand-up\, audience interaction\, and plenty of surprises. You'll
  laugh\, connect\, and leave feeling like you've spent the evening with one
  of your funniest friends. VIP guests will also enjoy an exclusive post-sho
 w meet & greet with Lisa. Whether you've followed her online for years or a
 re discovering her for the first time\, One Funny Lisa Marie delivers an up
 lifting\, high-energy comedy experience that has audiences across the count
 ry laughing together. Come see why millions have fallen in love with her hu
 mor—and prepare for a night you'll be talking about long after the show e
 nds!\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/one-funny-lisa-
 marie-67840/
